# The field tools are a signed-in app that must always load fresh (2026-10-04).
# SiteGround's Dynamic Cache kept serving the OLD app at /summit-de59ae83/ after an upload and a
# flush, while /summit-de59ae83/index.html was fresh, so phones opened yesterday's version.
# SiteGround's documented way to keep a non-WordPress folder out of the Dynamic Cache is
# Cache-Control "private" (siteground.com/kb/disable-dynamic-caching-website). After uploading
# this file, flush the Dynamic Cache once; uploads after that need no flush.
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
Header set Cache-Control "private, no-cache"
</IfModule>
